Package: wvsR
Type: Package
Title: Cross-Cultural Comparisons Using WVS Data
Description: Tools for profiling, comparing, and visualizing cultural dimensions derived from the World Values Survey (WVS) dataset. Emphasizes estimation, confidence intervals, and effect sizes in data visualization and reporting.
